function totp(secret){let bits='';for(const c of secret.toUpperCase().replaceAll('=',''))bits+='ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ234567'.indexOf(c).toString(2).padStart(5,'0');const bs=[];for(let i=0;i+8<=bits.length;i+=8)bs.push(parseInt(bits.slice(i,i+8),2));const b=Buffer.alloc(8);b.writeBigUInt64BE(BigInt(Math.floor(Date.now()/30000)));const d=createHmac('sha1',Buffer.from(bs)).update(b).digest();return String((d.readUInt32BE(d[d.length-1]&15)&0x7fffffff)%1000000).padStart(6,'0');}
